#: ../../source/honcho-memory-integration_SKILL.md:82
msgid "Best Practices"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/honcho-memory-integration_SKILL.md:84
msgid ""
"**Tag everything** — metadata tags enable precise filtering. Every memory"
" should have at least `context` and `status` tags."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/honcho-memory-integration_SKILL.md:85
msgid ""
"**Never raw-log** — curate before saving. Summarize → deduplicate → tag →"
" upsert."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/honcho-memory-integration_SKILL.md:86
msgid ""
"**Scope queries tightly** — use metadata filters, not just semantic "
"search. Prevents noisy retrievals."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/honcho-memory-integration_SKILL.md:87
msgid ""
"**Use hybrid recall** — combines semantic similarity with exact metadata "
"matching for best precision."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/honcho-memory-integration_SKILL.md:88
msgid ""
"**Archival discipline** — mark completed project memories as "
"`status:archived` rather than deleting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/honcho-memory-integration_SKILL.md:89
msgid ""
"**Async writes are safe** — Honcho's async write mode handles queuing and"
" retry automatically."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/honcho-memory-integration_SKILL.md:90
msgid ""
"**Check memory count** — regular monitoring of fact count per user/AI "
"peer to detect accumulation issues."
msgstr ""

