#: ../../source/honcho-memory-integration_SKILL.md:121
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/honcho-memory-integration_SKILL.md:123
msgid "\"Honcho session could not be initialized\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/honcho-memory-integration_SKILL.md:124
msgid "Common causes:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/honcho-memory-integration_SKILL.md:126
msgid ""
"**Truncated/redacted API key** — The `apiKey` field in "
"`~/.hermes/honcho.json` or `~/.hermes/honcho_api_key.env` may have been "
"saved as `hch-v3...xxxx` instead of the full key. Ensure both contain the"
" **full** key."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/honcho-memory-integration_SKILL.md:128
msgid ""
"**Recommended secret-handling pattern:** keep the key in `honcho.json` + "
"`honcho_api_key.env`, and configure Hermes to read it via env var "
"(`honcho.api_key_env: HONCHO_API_KEY`). Avoid embedding plaintext Honcho "
"keys directly in `~/.hermes/config.yaml` (clear `honcho.api_key` if "
"present)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/honcho-memory-integration_SKILL.md:130
msgid ""
"**Config file locations** (checked in this order by "
"`HonchoClientConfig.from_global_config()`):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/honcho-memory-integration_SKILL.md:131
msgid ""
"`$HERMES_HOME/honcho.json` -- primary config (JSON with `hosts` block + "
"`apiKey`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/honcho-memory-integration_SKILL.md:132
msgid "`~/.honcho/config.json` -- legacy global"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/honcho-memory-integration_SKILL.md:133
msgid ""
"Falls back to env vars (`HONCHO_API_KEY`, `HONCHO_BASE_URL`) if no file "
"found."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/honcho-memory-integration_SKILL.md:134
msgid ""
"**Also updated**: `$HERMES_HOME/config.yaml` -- `honcho.api_key` section "
"(gateway reads this)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/honcho-memory-integration_SKILL.md:136
msgid ""
"**Gateway restart required** -- After updating any config file, restart "
"the gateway. Be careful to kill **all** old processes first -- they may "
"respawn or conflict:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/honcho-memory-integration_SKILL.md:143
msgid ""
"If multiple gateway instances conflict (port/lock held), kill the older "
"one first. The second gateway will exit with \"PID already in use\" "
"errors."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/honcho-memory-integration_SKILL.md:145
msgid ""
"**Verify API key directly** -- If tools still fail after restart, test "
"with direct Python SDK:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/honcho-memory-integration_SKILL.md:155
msgid "This isolates whether the key is valid vs. a gateway/plugin init issue."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/honcho-memory-integration_SKILL.md:157
msgid ""
"**Honcho Python package must be installed** -- `pip show honcho_ai` "
"should exist."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/honcho-memory-integration_SKILL.md:159
msgid ""
"**Check gateway logs** -- `tail -50 ~/.hermes/logs/gateway.log` for "
"Honcho init messages. Look for \"Initializing Honcho client\" followed by"
" \"Honcho session 'hermes-agent' retrieved\" (success) vs. errors."
msgstr ""

